Halloween night, that happened to me. I've never hid the fact that my mystical/spiritual/psychological beliefs are anything but &quot;not mainstream&quot;. I talk to the street light to make then turn green. I threaten my computer to scare the gremlins inside. Last Halloween I had a visit from my great-grandmother and my grandfather and had a conversation with my totem (a bear of course, not a polar bear though). Earlier this year, I lost my grandmother, so I was hoping to get a visit from her.<br /> <br /> And what I got was nothing.<br /> <br /> I was out there completely alone.<br /> <br /> Nothing and no one came to visit.<br /> <br /> I don't even know what to do about it.<br /> <br /> I don't know how much of this is from the little asshole who lives in my head, but I keep thinking that I just need to walk away from all of it. The problem there is that these things, these beliefs, these practices are what has kept me away from the psychiatrist and the heavy medications they want to put me on.<br /> <br /> I don't want to go on their drugs. I can't talk to the spirits anymore. I am at an impasse.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> So, how's your day?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-04T07:45:53-08:00","id":302148,"title":"","content":"Eh, it's okay. Religious uncertainty sucks, doesn't it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bl