ent thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it's funny all the different names we give for basically the same food.<br /> <br /> I mean, really, there's only so many animals worth eating and only so many ways to cook them. After that, we're just pulling names out of our asses to make it seem like something else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T14:17:18-07:00","id":449764,"title":"","content":"Look, I made some pretties....<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://i1059.photobucket.com/albums/t435/Etherknyte/20150319_145054_zps9irgaoxz.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Bear Bracelet</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://s1059.photobucket.com/user/Etherknyte/media/20150318_102358_zpsfnxzlhax.jpg.html\" target=\"_blank\">Charm Bracelet</a><br /> <br /> Anyone know how to post the pics here instead of linking them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name"