ov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T21:32:01-07:00","id":499779,"title":"","content":"Shouldn't we wait for all of the Seemings to come out, at least?<br /> <br /> EDIT: As to all else.<br /> <br /> If there is an obstacle, find a way around it and find a way to get as much time for it as possible.<br /> <br /> If taken, I'll be honest and say it's a toss up between music, the internet and friends. Yes, those three are all equal with each other.<br /> <br /> I don't remember a lot of my dreams. When I do, they aren't good. I don't think I've ever had a solidly good dream sit in memory long enough to be aware of it in the waking world.<br /> <br /> As for the other two, I dunno at this point. I'm a poor judge of other people's assessment of myself, so I dunno what I'm most likely to be valued for-I can only work for what I want to be valued for. And I'm a little scared of what I would break to free myself. That's not an easy question to answer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 05-02-2015, 12:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T21:43:23-07:00","id":499781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\