Durance started very suddenly: a hand came thru your monitor and grabbed you. You didn't know one Keeper had actually made it to the internet. That's the last time you'll go to hedge.com. Anyway, he was looking for more storage capacity, so he turned you into a block of bits. Just a jumble of electricity being shifted around into a thousand pieces where needed. Only the Gentry was very new at this, and you knew a trick he'd never heard of: defrag. It was a simple thing to pop up a window suggesting this very basic maintenance, and he, like a noob, clicked right on it. Over night, all your pieces reassembled, including the bits that had been connected to the browser. One Back button click and you were home again, transformed into an Airborne Elemental, with a very electrical and knowledge bend to your ways.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm amused by that idea, but let's go tie breaker. To answer that, Yeah, a Stranger could make a sufficiently good enough deal. I have good connections to this world, but I can't ignore opportunity, and I'm reckless enough to make bad decisions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T12:30:19-07:00","id":509187,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/190691-the-rambling-rumble-part-2?p=509119#post509119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I don't eat pizza that often, and I like Adventures. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> HAVE YOU FORGOTTEN WHAT PIZZA-FUN MEANS,ARC??<br /> Anything. It can happen. Unicorns can have rampant, adorable sex across the countryside, lions could start talking and be a living Jesus metaphor, alligators could start fighting pythons on a massive scale in central Florida.<br /> <br /> Come on, man. Burn some fucking bridges! Alienate your friends and family! Just start tripping until reality starts feeling unreal! Have you forgotten what FREEDOM TASTES LIKE? Happy, safe pizza. Fuck you!</div> </div> </div> </div>My Little Pony: Pizza is Madness!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T15:26:16-07:00","id":509270,"title":"","content":"First of all, thank you for the welcoming and the poetry! Second, excuse my mistakes writing english. Third... here we go with the answers:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/190691-the-rambling-rumble-part-2?p=499699#post499699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When faced with an obstacle, what is your immediate, if not rational, reaction?</div> </div> </div> </div>My answer depends on what kind of obstacle it is:<br /> - If i think (even at instinctual level) that i can solve it, after a flash of frustration i go into it and try to solve it by the most logical way i can think of.<br /> - If i feel i cannot do anything about it, or maybe that is unfair, i usually rage... and then there's a little pause while i try to fight my own anger.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/190691-the-rambling-rumble-part-2?p=499699#post499699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you did get taken, what do you think you'd miss the most?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm seriously not sure about that. I think that i would arrive to the kind of situation that makes you to be surprised by the thing/person you're actually missing. Anyway, right now i'd say my hated/loved soon-to-be ex-girlfriend.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/190691-the-rambling-rumble-part-2?p=499699#post499699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How many dreams do you remember? Do you remember more good or bad?</div> </div> </div> </div>I half remember lots of dreams. The ones i remember clearly are usually of two types: the terrific ones, or those in which i'm flying. Lately i'm having more of the bad stuff.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/190691-the-rambling-rumble-part-2?p=499699#post499699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which one do YOU think you'd be? Don't explain why, just give Seeming and Kith.</div> </div> </div> </div>As i said, i couldn't tell, i'm noobish in Changeling stuff. I could tell you what Vampire Clan my friends were thinking for me, though, if it is of any help <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> ................<br /> <br /> Oh wait, do i have to answer also the tie breaker question too? Just in case, here it is:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/190691-the-rambling-rumble-part-2?p=506793#post506793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Option 2: the tie-breaker questions, which require even more personal insight.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">If a Keeper were to take you, how would they do it? Could they make a tempting enough offer? Would it be kicking &amp; screaming?</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>They definitely could offer something tempting enough.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":1349,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","user":"Phersus","date":".  Missed the tie breaker question! 05-09-2015, 06:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T08:45:13-07:00","id":509870,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/190691-the-rambling-rumble-part-2?p=499699#post499699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A few questions first:<br /> <br /> When faced with an obstacle, what is your immediate, if not rational, reaction?<br /> <br /> If you did get taken, what do you think you'd miss the most?<br /> <br /> How many dreams do you remember? Do you remember more good or bad?<br /> <br /> Which one do YOU think you'd be? Don't explain why, just give Seeming and Kith.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ok, I'm sober and not naked. Let's answer some questions:<br /> <br /> 1. Cold/Hot fury. I know. Not a sexy answer, but I literally yelled &quot;What the fuck are YOU looking at? Never seen a fat guy smoking a fucking cigarette?? Come on over, motherfucker. Come on!!&quot; yesterday. Turned out he's my new neighbor and he was just wondering who I was, just pacing my yard and smoking. <br /> <br /> 2. I'd probably miss my friends the most. Kinda bald response, but true.<br /> <br /> 3. I remember MOST of my dreams vividly, even years later. They've been, with one notable exception, absolutely terrifying since I was very small.<br /> <br /> 4. Seeming probably (I play as much CtL as I juggle chainsaws) and just so I can self-label, I'd probably turn out to be Ogre, Elemental or Bestial. Feel free to question any and all of my answers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T08:58:47-07:00","id":509891,"title":"","content":"Does no one here have decent dreams that make an impact?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T12:13:09-07:00","id":510090,"title":"","content":"Do you mind if I answer these as well? This looks like a fun and interesting game.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>When faced with an obstacle, what is your immediate, if not rational, reaction?</i><br /> <br /> <i>If you did get taken, what do you think you'd miss the most?</i><br /> <br /> <i>How many dreams do you remember? Do you remember more good or bad?</i><br /> <br /> <i>Which one do YOU think you'd be? Don't explain why, just give Seeming and Kith.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>1/Try to find a loophole, or the easy path. If I can, cheat my way around it.<br /> <br /> 2/I guess... my friends. At least some of them, which does sound cheesy, yes.<br /> <br /> 3/Only a few, and I mostly remember them for a few hours after I'm awake. Neither good or bad, but mostly weird, although some are fun.<br /> <br /> 4/Either Beast and Broadback, or Elemental and Woodblood. Or maybe Earthbones. It mostly depends if we're talking about the Kith/Seeming I'd like to be because of my interests, or the form which my Keeper would give me.<br /> <br /> And just in case, here is the tiebreaker question : <br /> <br /> <i>If a Keeper were to take you, how would they do it? Could they make a tempting enough offer? Would it be kicking &amp; screaming?</i><br /> <br /> Sadly, yes, I could definitely be tempted. Show me wonders and pleasures, offer me easy and peaceful solutions to my problems, and even if I might suspect a trap, I'll follow my Keeper.<br /> <br /> <br /> ...And now I just realized that most of my answers are depressing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T16:22:54-07:00","id":510228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/190691-the-rambling-rumble-part-2?p=509891#post509891\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does no one here have decent dreams that make an impact?</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you talking about the unconscious hallucinations or the hopes for the future type?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T16:24:27-07:00","id":510229,"title":"","content":"Unconscious hallucinations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"